title: Questions of Ideology
new-page: true
view-if: b_ideology_timer <= 0 and lenin_available = 1
on-arrival: b_ideology_timer += 2; week_actions += 1
frequency: 100
is-card: true
card-image: img/portraits/taburin_sd.jpg
tags: b_party

= Questions of Ideology

Within the Bolsheviks, there are several ideological currents. Most Bolsheviks will follow the predominant mood of the party, whatever that happens to be.

Which ideological current should be supported?

- @support_moderate
- @support_leninist
- @support_left
- @support_unity
- @root: No, we will not change any of our ideological positions.
- @easy_discard

@support_moderate
title: Promote the course of the Moderates. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.moderate_strength += 10; Q.leninist_strength -= 5; Q.leftcom_strength -= 5;
  Q.moderate_dissent -= 5; Q.leninist_dissent += 10; Q.leftcom_dissent += 10; 
!}

@support_leninist
title: Promote the course of the Leninists. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.moderate_strength -= 5; Q.leninist_strength += 10; Q.leftcom_strength -= 5;
  Q.moderate_dissent += 5; Q.leninist_dissent -= 5; Q.leftcom_dissent += 5; 
!}

@support_left
title: Promote further radicalism and extremism. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.moderate_strength -= 5; Q.leftcom_strength += 5; Q.vperedist_strength += 2;
  Q.moderate_dissent += 5; Q.leftcom_dissent -= 10; Q.vperedist_dissent -= 5;
!}

@support_left
title: Promote the avant-garde projects of the Vperedists. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.leftcom_strength += 2; Q.vperedist_strength += 10;
  Q.leninist_dissent += 5; Q.leftcom_dissent -= 5; Q.vperedist_dissent -= 10;
!}

@support_unity
title: Call for greater party unity among the factions. 
on-arrival: {!
  Q.moderate_dissent -= 5; Q.leninist_dissent -= 5; Q.leftcom_dissent -= 5; Q.vperedist_dissent -= 5;
  Q.b_dissent * 0.75; 
!}

